		}
		{
			dependencies: ["197291772F9B2479"]
			description: ["Reach the Nether with enough supplies to bring magma, soul aggregate, netherrack, and refractory heat proof home. Basic seared work can begin from any Font route; the Nether now opens scorched metallurgy and sustained industry."]
